  "sourceTitle": "How an Agent Built a 3D Paris Gallery by Chaining Two Hugging Face Spaces",
  "sourceBodyHash": "090740caa213d03f50ea6263f8b761f6564faa6db2187c8f1c400f986dbfbe11",
